        104.61104583740234,
        522.2130737304688,
        183.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "30. We may have to start considering whether we are treating robots fairly.\n31. Robots are probably of more help to us on Earth than in space.\n32. The ideas in high-quality science fiction may prove to be just as accurate as\nthose found in the work of mediocre scientists.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        184.0520477294922,
        456.3270263671875,
        222.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "33. There are those who look forward to robots developing greater\nintelligence.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        269.7320251464844,
        169.10899353027344,
        289.2334289550781
      ],
      "text": "Questions 34–36\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
